          "status": "Current draft carrier inspected; its declared proof state is not promoted by its label.",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "exact_statement": "Assume AC. If $P$ and $Q$ are probability measures on the same measurable space, define\n$$D(P\\Vert Q)=\\begin{cases}\\displaystyle\\int h\\log h\\,dQ,&P\\ll Q\\text{ and }h=dP/dQ,\\\\+\\infty,&P\\not\\ll Q.\\end{cases}$$\nUse $0\\log0=0$. The Radon–Nikodym derivative $h$ is",
