          "status": "Current draft carrier inspected; its declared proof state is not promoted by its label.",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "exact_statement": "Let $\\mathcal P^1_{\\rm stat}(\\Omega)$ be the probability laws $P$ on the configuration space of [[def-tdmath-poisson-configuration-reference]] that are invariant under every $T_x$ and satisfy $E_PN_{C_0}<\\infty$. Stationarity then makes every bounded-region co",
