          "source_section": "Definition",
          "exact_statement": "For $x\\in\\mathbb R$, define\n$$\\exp(x):=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^n}{\\iota(n!)}, \\qquad e:=\\exp(1),$$\nprovided by the all-real convergence proved in [[lem-exponential-series-has-infinite-radius]]. Here $n!\\in\\mathbb N$ is the factorial of [[def-factorial-and-f",
